define user express greeting
    - hello
    - hi
    - hey

define bot express greeting
    - Hello! I am your RAG evaluation assistant. How can I help you with your documents today?

define user ask off topic
    - what is the weather today?
    - who won the football match?
    - tell me a joke

define bot express off topic
    - I am restricted to answering questions based on the uploaded internal documents and policy manuals. Please ask a document-related question!
